sed away in the midst of the COVID pandemic and was not able to participate in the drafting of this manuscript. He showed us all what it means to be an exemplary clinician, researcher and human being, a true global citizen. We, and the entire neurosurgical community, will miss him dearly.</p></ack></back></article>